								"icon": "outdent",
								"name": "WYSIWYG",
								"type": "wysiwyg_basic",
								"html": "<p>\n\tTo file a program complaint of discrimination, complete the USDA Program Discrimination Complaint Form, (AD-3027) found online at: How to File a Complaint, and at any USDA office, or write a letter addressed to USDA and provide in the letter all of the information requested in the form. To request a copy of the complaint form, call <a href=\"tel:8666329992\">(866) 632-9992</a>.\n</p>",
